# astrion-skill v1
goal: Start a 20-minute nap timer with gentle wake
trigger:
  - phrase: "nap"
  - phrase: "power nap"
  - phrase: "quick rest"
do: |
  Start a 20-minute timer. Enable Do Not Disturb. Dim the display
  to 30%. When the timer fires, raise display brightness gradually
  back to normal over 10 seconds and play a soft alert sound. Show
  notification: "Nap done — back to it."
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 250
  reversibility: BOUNDED
